{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the boundless skies with your little plane! Fly through clouds and obstacles, feeling the wind whipping through your wings\u2014but remember, your true enemy isn't just the obstacles ahead; it's the roaring tornado behind you. It's closing in on you, and all you can do is accelerate, dodge, and persevere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is one: fly over 100 kilometers and claim that untouchable medal of honor. This is not only a test of skill, but also a test of will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, pure challenge: every move determines how far you can fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Are you ready for this marathon in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/21c76b17e64f1e4f3fdde1dcd3eeac16.avif?t=1762011406\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2328\ufe0f</strong> Keyboard Controls: \u2191 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 <strong>/</strong> <strong>WSAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: <strong>Spacebar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: <strong>ESC key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae</strong> Gamepad Controls: Left Stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: Y</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\ud83d\udc51Lv.100!\ud83d\udc51","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/056952dd524cc4c982c3140b424c3abc08c60b11.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.1\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/8b9b6b52187c58503cd08bf